OL,3,GNEWSAPolitics and pedestrians: How
OL,4,Atraffic was removed from Oxford Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn a bright, summer's day at City Hall
OL,7,Fin 2024, the mayor of London's senior
OL,8,Fadvisers were in a room mulling over
OL,9,Fhow to solve the most contentious of
OL,10,Fissues - getting vehicles off Oxford
OL,11,FStreet.
OL,13,FIn the planning meeting, they were
OL,14,Fadvocating a new approach.
OL,16,FThe thorny issue of the
OL,17,Fpedestrianisation of London's most
OL,18,Ffamous shopping street had foxed
OL,19,Fmayoral administrations for years.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
