OL,3,GNEWSAPolitics and pedestrians: How
OL,4,Atraffic was removed from Oxford Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery time a new plan emerged, it was
OL,7,Fscrapped by Westminster Council, who
OL,8,Fowned the street and could be swayed by
OL,9,Fthe marginal seats on either side of
OL,10,Fthe debate.
